Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.12,0:01:22.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老歌99.2\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oldies 99.2{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.96,0:01:28.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个地区的周末天气预报看起来不错\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, the weekend forecast looking good for the area.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.00,0:01:31.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从布伦特伍德一直到里奇蒙\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sunny skies on tap from brentwood all the way north to Richmond...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.00,0:01:35.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以及整个维吉尼亚州都是晴空万里  \N最高气温达摄氏29度\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and throughout the state of Virginia, with highs reaching 85 degrees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.30,0:01:37.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚上最低气温大约摄氏18度\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Low tonight, about 65.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.22,0:01:39.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个周末应该很适合登山客出去玩\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should be a great weekend for hikers to get out and enjoy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.28,0:01:56.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你女儿真漂亮\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.90,0:01:58.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定为她骄傲\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must be one proud papa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.66,0:02:04.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个黑人是谁\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's the black fella?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.66,0:02:07.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达瑞斯克莱蒙斯  是她男朋友\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Darius clemmons. It's her boyfriend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.79,0:02:10.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们和一群朋友一起旅行\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were traveling with a group of their friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.67,0:02:14.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿帕拉契山路范围很广\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, the appalachian trail's a hefty piece of real estate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.01,0:02:17.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从缅因州一直到乔治亚州\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, Maine clear down to Georgia way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.30,0:02:19.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直在追踪他们的路线\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been tracking their route,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.97,0:02:23.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她答应每周给我打电话或发简讯\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and she promised to call or text every week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.43,0:02:25.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经有六周了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it's been six weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.18,0:02:29.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她最后一次给我发简讯是在你们镇上\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The last place that she texted me was here in your town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.61,0:02:34.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实来这里的孩子太多了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, the fact is we get a shit-ton of kids that come through here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.48,0:02:39.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们来了  做了他们想做的  然后离开\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, they come, and they do whatever it is they do, and they move on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.91,0:02:42.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我儿子在坦帕的乡村摇滚乐团玩键盘\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My boy's down in tampa playing keyboard in some rockabilly band.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.91,0:02:44.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都不记得那孩子  \N上次和我通电话是什么时候了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't remember the last time that boy picked up a phone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.99,0:02:46.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我女儿不是那样的人\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My daughter's not like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.16,0:02:52.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你愿意  我们可以正式一点\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we can make it official if you'd like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.09,0:02:54.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,填一下这份失踪人口报告\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fill out this missing persons report.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.05,0:02:57.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想怎么写  就怎么写\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be as detailed as you'd like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.63,0:02:59.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果是我  我打赌\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if I were to put money on it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.68,0:03:02.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得她在某个小岛晒太阳呢\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd say she's somewhere sunning herself in the keys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.97,0:03:07.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,客人退房是自动的  我很少看到他们离开\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guest checkout is automatic. I rarely see them leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.93,0:03:12.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大部分在日出前就走了  想赶上飞机或避开塞车\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most are gone by sun up, trying to catch flights or beat traffic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.48,0:03:14.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,房间里什么都没有吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there was nothing left in the room?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.15,0:03:16.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有  他们的车也不见了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. And their car was gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.32,0:03:17.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, well,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.65,0:03:21.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你想到什么请给我打电话  好吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you think of anything, please give me a call, yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.24,0:03:23.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫史考特\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name's Scott.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.03,0:03:27.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跟警长讲过了?\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You spoke to the police chief?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.83,0:03:28.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.08,0:03:30.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得  他认为这没什么\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't sense much urgency from him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.04,0:03:33.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是个宁静的小镇\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a quiet town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.75,0:03:36.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,越宁静他钓鱼就钓得越多\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The quieter it is, the more he gets to fish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.59,0:03:43.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿  我是珍\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, it's Jen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.14,0:03:46.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请留言我会回电  谢谢  拜\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave a message, and I'll hit you back. Thanks, bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.01,0:03:49.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再看看  拜托\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look again. Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.35,0:03:50.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  抱歉  不\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, sorry, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.52,0:03:52.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道有多少游客来这里吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know how many tourists come through here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.06,0:03:55.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记得的是酒  不是脸\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember drinks, not faces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.86,0:03:58.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丢东西了吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lose something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.86,0:04:03.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的女儿\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.24,0:04:06.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她叫珍妮弗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her name is Jennifer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.28,0:04:09.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她和五个朋友经过这里\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She passed through here with five of her friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.20,0:04:12.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们年龄差不多\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're all about the same age.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.29,0:04:14.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我见过他们\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I seen 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.92,0:04:16.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死的屁孩\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goddamn yuppies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.71,0:04:19.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有注意到他们往哪边走了吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't happen to notice which way they went?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.88,0:04:20.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,北边吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}North, maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.96,0:04:22.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去上面\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up on the at.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.59,0:04:28.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但如果他们在树林里迷路了  你还不如回家\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if they got lost in them woods, you might as well just go on home,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.97,0:04:31.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你永远也找不到他们\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'cause you ain't never gonna find 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.56,0:04:34.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.27,0:04:38.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不信呢  我不信\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe that. I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.15,0:04:41.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随你怎么想  先生  但你要知道\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Believe what you want, mister. But know this...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.11,0:04:44.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在外面\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out there,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.28,0:04:49.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大自然会吞噬掉所有能抓住的东西\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}nature eats everything it catches right down to the bone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.74,0:04:51.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本不在乎是不是个可爱的女孩\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't give a shit if it's a cute girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.42,0:05:00.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有孩子吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have kids?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.96,0:05:04.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会怎么做\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What would you do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.50,0:05:32.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(六星期前)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.50,0:05:43.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(欢迎光临维吉尼亚州)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.59,0:05:51.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得这张怎么样\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think of this one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.68,0:05:53.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挺好\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it's-it's fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.31,0:05:55.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚当  看看  什么  搞什么\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adam, come on. What? What the fuck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.39,0:05:57.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要用手机  我想给你看照片\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need that. I want to show you the picture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.39,0:05:58.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把手机给我  不\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me my phone. No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.98,0:06:00.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿  宝贝你没事的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Babe, you're fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.73,0:06:03.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,深呼吸\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just breathe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.19,0:06:04.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敞开心扉\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open your mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.99,0:06:06.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好享受  好吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enjoy it, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.28,0:06:09.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看那个  我一直看起来就那么死臭脸吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at that one. Is that how sad I look all the time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.20,0:06:10.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  没错\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, you do, actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.99,0:06:13.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一定很爱你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must really love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.12,0:06:16.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  真奇怪你这么爱\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really do. It's-it's weird how much you love...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.16,0:06:17.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真奇怪\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.12,0:06:19.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吻我\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now kiss me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.71,0:06:24.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇哦  啊\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa! Ah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.43,0:06:32.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这样让我很难堪\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, uh, you're making me look bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.05,0:06:35.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  不用担心  这才是女权\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry. Don't be. Fucking girl power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.02,0:06:38.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女权\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Girl power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.64,0:06:41.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女孩你在哪学的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dude, where'd you learn how to do this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.02,0:06:43.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爸\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.98,0:06:45.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他教会了我两件事\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He taught me two things:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.23,0:06:48.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么做鱼饵  怎么换轮胎\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How to bait a hook and how to change a tire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.40,0:06:50.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爸教我怎么塞卫生棉条\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dad taught me how to put in a tampon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.16,0:06:53.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,单身父亲\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Single parent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.37,0:06:54.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他一直闭着眼睛\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His eyes were closed the whole time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.95,0:06:56.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可不是什么好经历\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a good experience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.29,0:07:03.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.38,0:07:04.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以了  太好了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, here we go. Sweet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.67,0:07:06.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍  珍  珍\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jen, Jen, Jen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.21,0:07:07.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的英雄\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My fucking hero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.47,0:07:13.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这真古典\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's quaint.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.64,0:07:18.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  尤其是如果你怀念邦联的美好时光\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, especially if you miss the good old days of the confederacy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.78,0:07:28.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.28,0:07:29.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个是我的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This one's mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.90,0:07:31.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是你的  宝贝  拿你的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's yours, babe. Trying to grab yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.74,0:07:32.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把我的给我\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pass me mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.83,0:07:43.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三间房  两晚是的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three rooms for two nights. Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.08,0:07:46.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,旅馆的规章制度都贴在你们的房间里\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Policies of the inn are posted in your rooms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.00,0:07:48.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露台上不准喝酒\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No alcohol on the patio.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.84,0:07:52.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,房间里不准点蜡烛  不准放大声的音乐或吵闹\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No candles in the room, no loud music or raucous activity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.09,0:07:54.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听到了吗  男孩们  规矩点\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hear that, boys? Behave yourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.89,0:08:01.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢  别担心  我会管好他们的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks. And don't worry. I'll keep them on a short leash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.48,0:08:03.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以前来过这里吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you been here before?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.06,0:08:06.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我第一次来  只是徒步旅行\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First time. Just doing a little hiking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.61,0:08:11.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给你个建议  沿着标记的路走\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Piece of advice, keep to the marked trail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.36,0:08:15.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里的土地是残酷无情的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The land here can be unforgiving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.70,0:08:20.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢  我们会小心的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks. We'll be careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.47,0:08:43.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道有一群废奴主义者  是来自这个镇上吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know that a bunch of abolitionists came from this town?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.06,0:08:47.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达瑞斯喜欢那东西  该死的历史  宝贝\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Darius loves that shit. Fucking history, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.06,0:08:50.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那时人们还在为自己的信仰而战\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back when people actually fought for what they believed in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.69,0:08:53.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了那是什么  之前那是什么\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, by the way, what was that... What was that thing earlier?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.49,0:08:55.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么不牵我的手\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why wouldn't you hold my hand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.32,0:08:56.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么  没有原因\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing. No reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.03,0:08:58.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是有原因的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, there's a reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.83,0:09:01.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和达瑞斯紧张的原因一样\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Same reason Darius is on edge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.49,0:09:02.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚当  老兄弟\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adam. Dude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.87,0:09:05.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么  他是个黑人有个白人女友\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? He's a black dude with a white girlfriend{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.87,0:09:07.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在维吉尼亚州\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in bum-fuck Virginia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.79,0:09:10.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.38,0:09:18.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不是本地人吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Y'all ain't from around here, are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.97,0:09:20.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什么暴露了我们\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What gave us away?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.97,0:09:22.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.27,0:09:26.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们只是来看看阿帕拉契山路\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're just, uh, checking out the appalachian trail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.14,0:09:28.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,徒步旅行几天  没什么特别的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Couple days of hiking. Nothing extreme.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.94,0:09:30.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上面有危险的东西\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something dangerous up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.90,0:09:34.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你有任何问题或需要指导\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So if you got any questions or you need a guide,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.44,0:09:36.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和我的朋友们  我们对这片土地\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}me and my pals over here, we, uh, we know this land{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.99,0:09:39.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无比了解\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like the back of our hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.49,0:09:42.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢谢谢  我想我们不用\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks. Thanks. I think we're good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.79,0:09:44.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你的决定\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.29,0:09:47.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但如果你改变主意了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, uh, if you change your mind...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.21,0:09:49.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们随叫随到\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll always be around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.05,0:09:57.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开着一辆破皮卡喝着私酿烈酒  对吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Driving around in a shitty pickup, sipping moonshine, am I right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.30,0:09:58.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.59,0:09:59.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么  啄木鸟\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What'd you say, peckerwood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.89,0:10:02.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请原谅我的未婚夫\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse my fiancee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.10,0:10:05.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他忘了跟人聊天和在网路上当键盘侠不一样\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He forgets that talking to people isn't like commenting on reddit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.94,0:10:08.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别看我  小子\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't look at me, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.73,0:10:14.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们这些屁孩  就是这个世界的问题所在\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You goddamn hipster freaks are the problem with this whole world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.86,0:10:17.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我打赌你们中没有一个人\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm betting not a goddamn one of you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.32,0:10:20.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做过真正的工作\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ever worked a real fucking job in your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.03,0:10:24.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你们最好乖乖坐着\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you better sit the fuck still and behave yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.12,0:10:29.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你错了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.29,0:10:31.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.09,0:10:35.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我男朋友达瑞斯经营一家非盈利  公益环保能源机构\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My boyfriend, Darius, runs a sustainable energy nonprofit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.13,0:10:37.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米拉是个肿瘤学家  亚当是个软件开发人员\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Milla's an oncologist. Adam's an app developer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.76,0:10:40.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,盖瑞和路易斯在纽约开了一家小酒馆\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Gary and Luis own a pair of New York bistros.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.34,0:10:43.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会称这些为真正的工作\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. I'd call those real jobs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.01,0:10:46.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你呢  亲爱的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what about you, sweetheart?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.39,0:10:47.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有两个硕士学位\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have two master's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.68,0:10:49.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艺术史和舞蹈\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Art history and dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.48,0:10:51.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是说  我以煮咖啡为生\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which means I make coffee for a living.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.86,0:10:54.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但现在我看着你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But right now I'm looking at you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.44,0:10:56.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到你眼睛发黄了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'm seeing some yellowing in your eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.07,0:10:58.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看这有什么问题  米拉\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which means what, Milla? Hmm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.32,0:11:01.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是肝脏问题\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, um, it could be liver problems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.49,0:11:04.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像是吉伯特氏症候群(黄疸)  肝炎等\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jaundice, hepatitis, Gilbert syndrome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.70,0:11:07.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该去看医生\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should probably see a doctor, actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.67,0:11:13.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.46,0:11:15.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子们  注意安全\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You kids be safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.38,0:11:19.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许我们还会再见面\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we'll see you again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.55,0:11:27.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说真的  别再这样了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seriously, do not do that ever again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.39,0:11:29.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我受不了  老兄  我们为什么让你喝酒\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't handle that. Dude, why do we let you drink?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.43,0:11:30.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为通常我都很搞笑\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because usually I'm very funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.77,0:11:33.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  事实上你从来都不搞笑\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, actually, you have never, ever been funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.27,0:11:34.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从来都不\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like, never.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.56,0:11:35.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,酒呢\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are the drinks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.36,0:11:40.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道这首歌\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know this song.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.82,0:11:42.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.70,0:11:44.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  但这是首好歌\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, but it's a good song.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.05,0:12:01.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  各位  早上八点准时出发\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, people, 8:00 A.M.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.97,0:12:04.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,路易斯  盖瑞  我在跟你们说话\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Luis, Gary, I'm talking to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.09,0:12:05.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  我不喜欢早起\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I'm not a morning person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.85,0:12:07.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我不能睡满8小时  我就会变成僵尸\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I don't get my eight hours, I will be a zombie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.93,0:12:09.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就当一个徒步旅行的僵尸  嘿  各位\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be a zombie who hikes. Hey, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.85,0:12:12.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伙伴们  怎么了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys. What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.10,0:12:14.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,车旁边的是谁\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's that by the car?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.69,0:12:16.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是酒吧里的混蛋吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that one of those assholes from the bar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.90,0:12:18.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, probably.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.86,0:12:20.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿  亚当\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Adam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.90,0:12:22.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别冲动  嘿\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Relax. Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.95,0:12:24.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离车远点\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get away from the car, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.95,0:12:28.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离那里远点走开\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get away from there. Shoo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.20,0:12:30.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不是狗  喂\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not a dog. Yo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.20,0:12:33.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是聋了还是怎么了  给我退后\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you deaf or something? Back the fuck off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.46,0:12:38.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊  亚当你是想惹毛这里所有的人吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus, Adam, are you trying to piss off everyone in middle America?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.25,0:12:39.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得对这些人强硬点\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta be tough with these people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.00,0:12:41.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  大块头该睡觉了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, big guy, time for bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.51,0:12:42.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  帮我壮胆\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Back me up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.84,0:12:44.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚当\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.55,0:12:46.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, forget about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.14,0:12:47.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那家伙跑哪去了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where the hell did that guy go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.85,0:12:49.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.60,0:12:51.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好  我是史考特\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi this is Scott.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.31,0:12:53.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请留言  我会尽快回复谢谢\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave a message and I'll get right back to you. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.31,0:12:56.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老爸  抱歉这么晚打给你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, dad. Sorry to call so late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.27,0:12:58.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还在阿帕拉契山路徒步旅行\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're still hiking the appalachian trail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.27,0:13:00.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等我回来  我保证会告诉你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I get back, I promise I'll give you an answer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.28,0:13:01.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的计划\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about what I plan to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.32,0:13:06.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.28,0:13:07.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟科琳打个招呼\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say hi to Corinne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.66,0:13:09.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许她会跟你打个招呼\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe she'll say hi back for a change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.70,0:13:12.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的  回头聊\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, talk soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.58,0:13:15.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.25,0:13:18.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚当说得对吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So is Adam right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.25,0:13:19.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你紧张吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you on edge?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.80,0:13:22.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们现在就可以回家\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can go home right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.13,0:13:25.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想得美  但你可以不用保护我\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, nice try, but you don't have to protect me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.47,0:13:35.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我为什么在环保能源机构工作  \N而不是华尔街吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know why I work in nonprofit instead of on wall street?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.56,0:13:39.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.07,0:13:44.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想建立一个社区\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to build a community where people are valued{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.99,0:13:48.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那里重视的是人们的才能和性格\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on their skills and their character.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.91,0:13:55.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是他们的银行存款或肤色\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not their bank account or their skin color.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.67,0:13:59.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都有工作\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.42,0:14:02.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家分享\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone shares.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.13,0:14:07.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我愿为此付出一切\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd give anything for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.80,0:14:09.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.06,0:14:14.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我才爱你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.65,0:15:03.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真漂亮  这些都是你做的吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are beautiful. Did you make all this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.65,0:15:06.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一些\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.19,0:15:09.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.57,0:15:12.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是珍  你叫什么名字\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Jen. What's your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.20,0:15:16.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别介意露丝\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't mind ruthie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.95,0:15:18.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她不喜欢说话\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She don't like to talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.37,0:15:20.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在她这个年纪也很害羞\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was shy too at her age.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.29,0:15:23.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是你女儿吗  算是吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is she yours? In a manner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.21,0:15:26.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,养孩子需要全村人的努力  不是吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It takes a village to raise a child, isn't that what they say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.92,0:15:27.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多少钱\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.05,0:15:29.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十块钱\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten dollars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.43,0:15:38.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.77,0:15:43.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早安\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.19,0:15:45.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的从没见过你穿这件\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've literally never seen you wear this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.11,0:15:46.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇哦  好\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow. Wow. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.53,0:15:50.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.65,0:15:53.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,害羞之行\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walk of shame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.21,0:16:05.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们好啊  我和盖瑞要去远足\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, what's up, you guys? Me and Gary are going on a hike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.13,0:16:06.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道你在拍\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't know that you were filming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.00,0:16:09.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都到了是的  是一个YouTube影片\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone's here. Yeah, it's for a YouTube video.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.00,0:16:19.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(阿帕拉契山径  往南  往北)
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.31,0:16:24.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,背我\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Catch me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.98,0:16:29.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天啊  救命啊\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my god! Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.65,0:16:34.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真漂亮  大自然\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, it's beautiful. Nature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.11,0:16:36.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨晚还有人喝醉了吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is anyone still drunk from last night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.20,0:16:38.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混球  是我\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bitch, I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.20,0:16:39.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后一杯不是个好主意\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That last shot was a bad idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.16,0:16:42.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  看来这条路到头了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, looks like the trail ends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.41,0:16:45.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是往这边走  还是往那边走\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we going this way, or are we going this way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.25,0:16:47.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你手机有信号吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have signal on your phone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.63,0:16:48.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.67,0:16:52.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有  我的信号太差了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can do that. I've been horrible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.97,0:16:56.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧瞧啊  太他妈棒了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at that. This is fucking awesome!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.05,0:16:59.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.40,0:17:09.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去上面\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.78,0:17:15.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.69,0:17:49.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我们要去哪吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know where we're going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.27,0:17:50.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.23,0:17:51.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我们要去哪吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know where we're going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.70,0:17:58.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了伙伴们  来个快速小旅行\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, quick little side trip, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.61,0:18:00.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么  这附近应该有\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? There's supposed to be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.24,0:18:02.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保存完好的内战要塞\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a very well-preserved civil war fort near here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.83,0:18:04.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不错嘛  我们去找吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cool. Let's find it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.04,0:18:07.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,旅馆的女人说我们不该离开小路\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um, the woman at the inn said we shouldn't leave the trail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.67,0:18:09.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是随便看看\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just a quick look around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.63,0:18:13.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宝贝  如果什么都找不到  \N我们就回到小路上来\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Babe, if we don't find anything, we'll just cut back over to the trail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.13,0:18:16.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道如果我们沿着小路走  会发现什么吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what we wouldn't have found if we would have stayed on the trail?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.72,0:18:18.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  瀑布\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm? The waterfall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.01,0:18:21.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悬崖呢\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that cliff, hmm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.55,0:18:24.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  我们会没事的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. We'll be good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.18,0:18:28.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  好吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Okay?{\r}
