Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.73,0:52:31.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,霍布斯\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hobbs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.23,0:52:39.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到他们每个人  在镇上和山上\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw each of them, in town and on the mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.28,0:52:45.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个朝我扔瓶子\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That one threw a bottle at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.78,0:52:48.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不  天啊  亚当\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no. Jesus, Adam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.12,0:52:51.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说我们坏话\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He says vile words about us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.71,0:52:54.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他恨我们\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He hates us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.35,0:53:08.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩根\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morgan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.85,0:53:15.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩根\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morgan...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.31,0:53:17.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我们你看到了什么\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell us what you saw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.37,0:53:28.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,山缪\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Samuel...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.45,0:53:34.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在说什么\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}W-w-what is he saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.96,0:53:41.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我哥哥山缪和我出去打猎了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"My brother, Samuel, and I were out hunting."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.97,0:53:49.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为过冬存粮而跟踪驼鹿和麋鹿\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Stalking moose and elk for the winter larder."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.47,0:53:58.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在检查洞穴里的捕猎陷阱  \N将捉到的猎物拖进洞穴\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"We were checking our game traps in the cave where caught game is dragged{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.61,0:54:00.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以防止其他猎食者靠近\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to keep predators from getting to it."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.57,0:54:03.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  亚当\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah! Adam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.32,0:54:10.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们发现了这个陌生人\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"And we found this stranger instead."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.46,0:54:19.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他受伤了  昏过去了  我们要带他下山\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"He was hurt, knocked out. We were taking him down the mountain."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.01,0:54:26.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打算把他留在被发现的地方\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Planned to leave him where he'd be found..."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.31,0:54:37.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当其他人跟我们起冲突的时候\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"When these others attacked us."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.99,0:54:49.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他杀了我哥哥山缪\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"He killed my brother Samuel."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.66,0:54:51.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我们不知道\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. We didn't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.83,0:54:54.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们戴着动物头骨\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were wearing skulls,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.45,0:54:57.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身体披着树叶  还有血迹\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and their bodies were covered with leaves and blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.17,0:55:01.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然我们打猎时要怎么穿\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What we wear when we go hunting, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.34,0:55:05.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不就是隐藏我们的气味和样貌  不被猎物发现\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To hide our scent and our faces from our prey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.13,0:55:06.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们打猎时也一样\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your hunters do the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.92,0:55:08.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.88,0:55:12.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他做了摩根指控的事吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did he do what Morgan has accused?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.14,0:55:17.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这个人杀了摩根的哥哥山缪吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did this man murder Morgan's brother, Samuel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.64,0:55:23.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敢撒谎  恐惧会降临在你们每个人身上\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lie, and dread will fall on each of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.03,0:55:26.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我警告你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I warn you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.36,0:55:29.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说实话\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Speak true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.79,0:55:37.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.71,0:55:42.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他没有杀他\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He didn't murder him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.27,0:56:02.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露丝\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ruthie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.78,0:56:13.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露丝  谁杀了山缪\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ruthie, who killed Samuel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.41,0:56:20.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你对法庭撒谎了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You lied to this court.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.67,0:56:23.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.25,0:56:24.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚当担心自己的生命安全\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adam feared for his life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.84,0:56:27.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他出于自卫杀了这个人\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He killed this man in self-defense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.25,0:56:28.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是谋杀\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not murder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.63,0:56:30.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们以为他们绑架了他\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We thought they were kidnapping him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.80,0:56:32.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们以为他们要带他去某个地方杀了他\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We thought they were taking him somewhere to kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.05,0:56:35.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么  你为什么会这么想\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why? Why did you think this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.51,0:56:38.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有什么证据\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What proof did you have?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.39,0:56:41.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你见过我们的人吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Had you met any of our people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.94,0:56:45.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们伤害过你吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Had we caused you any harm?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.95,0:57:01.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本庭宣判你谋杀罪名成立\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This court finds you guilty of murder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.58,0:57:04.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,判决是死刑  什么\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sentence is death. What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.88,0:57:07.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不  不  我没有  那是误会\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, I didn't... It was a mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.59,0:57:09.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道他们在做什么\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't know what they were doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.42,0:57:11.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是我的错\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not my fault!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.80,0:57:16.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退后\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gget back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.22,0:57:18.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想让这孩子跟你哥哥一起死吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want this kid to join your brother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.22,0:57:20.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就给我退后\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then back the fuck off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.43,0:57:21.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚当亚当  不\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adam, Adam, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.93,0:57:24.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴  亚当\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up. Hey, hey, Adam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.56,0:57:27.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你伤害了她  我们的处境都会更糟\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you hurt her, you make things worse for all of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.81,0:57:31.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看周围  达瑞斯  情况已经更糟了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look around, dar. This shit's already worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.07,0:57:34.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  你要这么做\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, this is what you're gonna do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.24,0:57:40.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要给我的朋友松绑然后放我们走\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to untie my friends, and then you're going to let us go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.16,0:57:43.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不怕你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not afraid of you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.12,0:57:46.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只想尽可能离你们这些混蛋鬼地方\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just want to get as far away from you backwoods fucks{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.33,0:57:47.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,越远越好\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as I possibly can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.50,0:57:49.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走开\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.75,0:57:51.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看着你的眼睛\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I look in your eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.30,0:57:55.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只看到了恐惧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see only fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.64,0:57:58.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这样的人没有未来\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no future for men like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.39,0:58:01.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去你妈的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.48,0:58:07.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不该叫你男人\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was wrong to call you a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.77,0:58:13.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他人因作伪证而有罪\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The rest of you are guilty for bearing false witness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.53,0:58:15.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,判决是黑暗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sentence is darkness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.20,0:58:16.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么  不不不求你了求你了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? No, no, no. Please, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.07,0:58:19.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带走  求你了  不要\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take them. Please, please, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.53,0:58:21.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你了  不要不\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, no! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.37,0:58:25.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍  珍\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jen! Jen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.38,0:58:30.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.90,0:59:01.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个家庭应该受到惩罚\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This family is owed retribution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.45,0:59:03.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,山缪是怎么被杀的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How was Samuel murdered?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.83,0:59:07.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说出来\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say the words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.12,0:59:10.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,山缪是怎么被杀的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How was Samuel murdered?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.93,0:59:20.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的头被打\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was struck in the head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.44,0:59:33.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用这个\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.20,0:59:39.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不不\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.57,0:59:40.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  别这样\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, don't do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.78,0:59:42.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这样  求你了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't do this, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.03,0:59:45.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你了这是不对的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please. It's wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.54,0:59:47.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这太野蛮了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's barbaric.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.33,0:59:48.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听我说  听我说\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me, listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.87,0:59:50.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以帮你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.67,0:59:52.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们什么都愿意做\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll do anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.00,0:59:55.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以给你钱  你说太野蛮了?\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can get you money... Barbaric?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.88,1:00:00.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的家族建造了这个地方\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our families built this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.18,1:00:03.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不同种族  不同信仰的男男女女来到这里\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Men and women of all races and creeds{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.30,1:00:08.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是为了躲避即将降临两国之间的世界末日\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}came here to avoid the armageddon they knew was coming between the states.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.02,1:00:11.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们需要的都有了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have everything we need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.02,1:00:17.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都在工作  每个人都有贡献\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone works. Everyone contributes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.28,1:00:20.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的食物新鲜充足\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our food is fresh and plentiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.15,1:00:24.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们没有癌症没有贫穷没有战争\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have no cancer, no poverty, no war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.62,1:00:29.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会因为你有  而我没有  所以彼此怨恨\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one hates another because they have while another doesn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.33,1:00:33.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是生命共同体的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are one body working together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.84,1:00:45.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你告诉我  谁的世界更野蛮?\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You tell me, whose world is more barbaric?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.94,1:00:54.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nol{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.28,1:01:07.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带走\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.30,1:01:25.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的判决是黑暗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your sentence is darkness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.39,1:01:29.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这里  你看不到恶\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, you will see no evil,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.26,1:01:32.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听不见恶  说不出恶\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}hear no evil, speak no evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.77,1:01:37.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.49,1:01:45.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦  不\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.28,1:01:46.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  等等  求你了  不要\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, wait. Please, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.07,1:01:48.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.45,1:01:50.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.29,1:01:58.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  不要\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah! Don't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.08,1:01:59.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达瑞斯  达瑞斯救我\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Darius! Darius, help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.96,1:02:01.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很抱歉  我很抱歉\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm s 0 ry! I'm s 0 ry{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.01,1:02:04.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  救我  不拜托\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no! Help me! No! Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.80,1:02:05.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你了  亲爱的上帝  别这样\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, dear god. Please don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.01,1:02:08.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.95,1:02:29.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滚开\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.54,1:02:37.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.79,1:02:39.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在犯错误\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're making a mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.83,1:02:42.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在浪费宝贵的资源\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're wasting valuable resources...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.09,1:02:46.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在浪费什么\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are we wasting?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.84,1:02:48.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.34,1:02:49.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们  我们\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Us. Us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.84,1:02:51.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有我们\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You-you have us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.64,1:02:52.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能用我们\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Use us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.01,1:02:54.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达瑞斯在非营利机构工作\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Darius works in nonprofit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.85,1:02:57.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他研究可持续能源  你在搞什么鬼\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He works in sustainable energy. What the hell are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.77,1:03:01.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他设计住宅  社区  社区自给自足\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's designed homes, neighborhoods, communities to be self-sufficient.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.56,1:03:03.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已经自给自足了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're already self-sufficient.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.11,1:03:06.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  但你需要维修改进\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, but you need maintenance, improvements.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.15,1:03:08.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们这会遭受风暴破坏  气候变化\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You suffer storm damage, climate changes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.91,1:03:11.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,泉水干涸你需要解决问题\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Springs dry up. You need problems solved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.49,1:03:12.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就是做这个的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what he does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.58,1:03:15.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是他的技能\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's his skill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.95,1:03:17.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是他能做的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what he can contribute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.54,1:03:20.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这么做  会失去一切\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do this, you lose all of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.88,1:03:24.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很强壮\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Standard says you're strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.13,1:03:25.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有战士精神\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a warrior spirit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.47,1:03:28.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会放弃\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't give up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.34,1:03:32.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你呢\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what of you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.89,1:03:34.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有什么提议\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you offer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.90,1:03:43.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我自己\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.99,1:03:50.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的家族没有疾病\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no sickness in my family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.53,1:03:53.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有癌症\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No cancer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.78,1:03:58.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我年轻  健康\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm young, healthy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.04,1:04:02.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会有强壮健康的孩子\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll have strong, healthy children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.93,1:04:14.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你手下谁需要妻子\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who among your men needs a wife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.64,1:04:17.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.02,1:04:26.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,张开嘴\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open your mouth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.61,1:04:33.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.95,1:04:38.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,张开腿\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spread your legs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.00,1:04:42.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,张开腿\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spread your legs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.37,1:04:44.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊迪丝\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Edith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.06,1:05:08.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你准备好成为忠诚的公民了吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you prepared to become a loyal citizen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.98,1:05:11.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.57,1:05:19.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你准备好成为忠诚的公民了吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you prepared to become a loyal citizen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.91,1:05:21.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.21,1:05:29.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你跑了  你应该知道下山没有安全的路\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you run, you should know there's no safe way off this mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.46,1:05:33.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我们的陷阱没能杀死你  动物会的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If our traps don't kill you, the animals will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.72,1:05:38.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果这片土地不杀你  我们的人会杀你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the land doesn't kill you, our people will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.10,1:05:43.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你不出一份力  你会在这里结束生命\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you don't contribute... You'll end up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.06,1:05:46.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们明白了吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.36,1:05:51.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.41,1:05:57.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  明白了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.02,1:06:23.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请不要恨我\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please don't hate me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.16,1:06:40.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,[外语]\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vee nor.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.17,1:06:48.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,[外语]\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vee nor.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.63,1:06:52.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vee nor what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.09,1:06:54.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朋友\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Friends?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.34,1:06:55.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是朋友的意思吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does that mean "friends?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.89,1:07:08.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.19,1:08:00.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经一年没有妻子了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've had no wife for a year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.37,1:08:10.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她摔死了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She died in a fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.08,1:08:17.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这里  人们要嘛死于意外  要嘛老死\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, people die of either accidents or old age.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.47,1:08:23.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能走了吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we ever leave?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.60,1:08:30.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么要这么做\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would you want to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.03,1:08:43.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我了解山下的生活\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know about life below.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.66,1:08:46.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你孤身一人\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.04,1:08:52.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人们到山里来找东西\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People come to the mountains looking for something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.54,1:08:57.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,提醒他们生命是有价值的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something to remind them that life is worth living.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.68,1:09:05.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是来找东西的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You came looking for something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.10,1:09:12.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在你找到了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now you've found it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.62,1:09:35.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没有你假装的那么坚强\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not as strong as you pretend to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.15,1:10:06.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是珍\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, it's Jen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.03,1:10:08.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请留言我会回电\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave a message, and I'll hit you back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.83,1:10:10.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢  拜\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks. Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.58,1:10:12.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,语音信箱已满\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mailbox is full{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.54,1:10:14.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在无法接收讯息  再见\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and cannot accept any messages at this time. Goodbye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.29,1:10:19.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.09,1:10:21.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我不知道\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.63,1:10:23.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能还要几天\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe a couple more days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.30,1:10:26.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在等当地警方的回覆然后再行动\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm waiting to hear back from the local police before I move on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.26,1:10:29.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.89,1:10:32.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她失踪了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's, uh... she's missing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.00,1:10:35.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(鹿啤餐厅)
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.95,1:10:54.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.79,1:10:57.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你女儿和她朋友的事我很遗憾\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry about your daughter and her friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.92,1:11:00.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,双份威士忌  谢谢\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Double whiskey. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.96,1:11:04.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我让她顺着小路走\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told her to stay on the trail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.92,1:11:08.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人住在那座山上\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are people living on that mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.97,1:11:12.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么人\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.43,1:11:17.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,创建会\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The foundation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.15,1:11:20.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,创建会\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The foundation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.94,1:11:24.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是一个大家都知道却不说的事\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a story people here know but don't talk about,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.44,1:11:26.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了偷偷讨论\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}except in whispers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.32,1:11:27.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像鬼故事一样\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like a ghost story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.95,1:11:29.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.24,1:11:34.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,1859年  十几个家庭收拾行李逃上山\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In 1859, a dozen or so families packed up and fled up the mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.83,1:11:39.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们害怕美国崩溃  想要保护他们的生活方式\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They feared the collapse of America, and wanted to protect their way of life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.67,1:11:41.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们说当美国沦陷时\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They said when America fell,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.67,1:11:47.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们将是建立新国家的基础\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they would be the foundation on which a new nation would be built.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.55,1:11:52.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些人的后代\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And these descendants of these people{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.43,1:11:56.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还住在山上吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are still living up there on the mountain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.10,1:11:58.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不打扰他们  他们也不打扰我们\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't bother them, and they don't bother us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.68,1:12:04.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但如果有人上去了  就再也回不来了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But anyone who goes up there, they don't come back...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.40,1:12:06.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无论死活\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alive or dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.74,1:12:10.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you know this how?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.95,1:12:13.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前也发生过\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's happened before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.45,1:12:14.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但如果以前发生过\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if it's happened before,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.99,1:12:17.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么没人做点什么\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}why hasn't someone done something about it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.62,1:12:20.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.54,1:12:23.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来像是他们离开了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's made to look like they left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.88,1:12:26.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.91,1:12:57.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不听我的话是吧  先生\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just don't listen, do you, mister?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.67,1:13:08.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的女儿死了  你不会想知道还剩下什么\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your girl is dead, and you don't want to find what's left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.59,1:13:10.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她没死\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's not dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.59,1:13:14.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你个狗娘养的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you son of a...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.52,1:13:21.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  等等\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on, hold on, hold on, hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.89,1:13:24.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.10,1:13:25.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.32,1:13:28.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不不\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.61,1:13:30.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.19,1:13:31.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扶他起来  嘿\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him up. Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.99,1:13:34.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这混蛋\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.64,1:14:01.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.31,1:14:08.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在做什么\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.31,1:14:09.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得我会做什么\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does it look like I'm doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.23,1:14:11.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不要上去\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't want to go up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.69,1:14:14.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是我女儿  我会找到她的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's my daughter. I'm gonna find her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.40,1:14:15.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史考特\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scott...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.36,1:14:17.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你无法阻止我\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there's nothing you can do to stop me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.66,1:14:19.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上帝啊  怎么了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus. What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.95,1:14:23.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你昨晚的伤跟山上他们的手段相比  根本不算什么\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever happened to you is nothing compared to what they'll do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.29,1:14:26.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.96,1:14:30.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以帮你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.02,1:14:49.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是他吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.52,1:14:51.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.15,1:14:52.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德  这是肖先生\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed, this is Mr. Shaw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.28,1:14:56.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德是我侄子  他是个猎人\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed's my nephew. He's a hunter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.20,1:14:58.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你出车祸了吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get in a car wreck or something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.91,1:15:00.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别的原因\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.16,1:15:01.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你带钱了吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got the money?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.45,1:15:06.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五千\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five thousand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.33,1:15:11.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.00,1:15:14.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那明早见\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll see you in the morning, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.42,1:15:15.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.01,1:15:17.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们现在就去\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We go now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.34,1:15:20.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有装备吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got gear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.97,1:15:23.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能穿成这样上去  这不是在休闲\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't go up there dressed for no ladies' tea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.93,1:15:25.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你需要眼镜吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need glasses?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.56,1:15:27.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,背包  睡袋  拐杖\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Backpack, sleeping bag, poles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.02,1:15:29.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了好了好了  库珀\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, okay, okay. Coop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.90,1:15:32.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把我的应急包扔给我\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toss me my go bag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.44,1:15:36.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面有你需要的一切\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got everything you need in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.44,1:15:39.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么不去把那件黄外套脱下来\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you go and take that yellow jacket off your back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.16,1:15:41.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你穿着像个靶心一样走来走去\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look like a fucking bull's-eye walking around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.37,1:15:42.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把钥匙给艾琳\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give the keys to Aileen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.83,1:15:44.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她会把你的车停在旅馆外面\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She'll park your car outside the inn,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.49,1:15:46.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伪装成你整晚都在那里\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}make it look like you been there all night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.91,1:15:48.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我问你个问题\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, let me ask you a question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.96,1:15:50.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么同意这么做\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why'd you agree to do this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.42,1:15:52.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为钱\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.33,1:15:55.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有个儿子想上焊接技术学校\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got a son here I want to send through welding school,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.13,1:15:59.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不喜欢那些创建会的混蛋\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I ain't got no love for them foundation fuckers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.34,1:16:02.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我中了箭\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arrow did that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.55,1:16:04.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,缝了十九针\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nineteen stitches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.06,1:16:08.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警告我远离他们的山\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A warning shot across the old brain pan to keep off of their mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.81,1:16:11.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不介意一报还一报\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wouldn't mind returning the favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.79,1:16:29.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退后\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa, whoa, whoa. Stay back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.54,1:16:37.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,木桩陷阱\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stake trap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.17,1:16:39.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狡猾的混蛋\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sneaky motherfuckers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.72,1:16:41.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离开小溪\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gget out of the creek.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.81,1:16:51.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,创建会的人喜欢设这种陷阱\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These foundation folks like to set traps like these{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.19,1:16:53.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逼陌生人下山\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to drive strangers up off the mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.10,1:16:57.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我中箭的地方还有第二种陷阱\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a second set further up where I got my trophy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.69,1:17:00.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二种会怎么样?\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What comes after the second set?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.20,1:17:02.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陌生人就活不了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Strangers don't get to leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.95,1:17:05.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要跟着我的脚步走\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You walk where I walk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.50,1:17:14.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上帝啊\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.83,1:17:16.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有多远\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much further?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.34,1:17:19.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,山脊上有条陡峭的小路\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a steep trail up along this Ridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.13,1:17:21.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我不会撒谎  这段路可不好走\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't lie, though. It's a bitch of a hike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.05,1:17:24.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这能让我们直接找到那混蛋的前门\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it shortcuts us right up to the bastards' front door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.89,1:17:28.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,库珀  库珀\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cooper! Cooper!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.10,1:17:29.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,库珀  你受伤了吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cooper, you hurt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.97,1:17:31.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.64,1:17:32.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好像扭到脚踝了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I twisted my ankle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.06,1:17:35.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊  来帮我把他拉出来\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Christ. Come on, help me pull him out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.19,1:17:37.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了把手给我\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, give me your hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.11,1:17:44.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另一只手给我\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me your other hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.50,1:17:57.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油加油\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.84,1:18:00.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.69,1:18:18.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.99,1:18:27.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,库珀\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cooper?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.79,1:18:34.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上帝啊\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.45,1:19:16.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一步一步来\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One step at a time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.57,1:20:34.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达瑞斯\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Darius?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.99,1:20:37.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, it's me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.12,1:20:42.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍在哪\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Jen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.38,1:20:46.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happened to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.09,1:20:54.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这他妈是怎么回事\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck is happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.43,1:20:59.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我女儿呢\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's my daughter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.27,1:21:01.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退后\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.11,1:21:12.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们这些人怎么回事\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong with you people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.68,1:21:39.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.27,1:21:42.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.98,1:21:46.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们对你做了什么\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have they done to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.87,1:21:58.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你对我女儿做了什么\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have you done to my daughter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.83,1:22:09.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管你是谁  这个女人不是你女儿\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoever you are... This woman is not your daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.63,1:22:12.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是我妻子\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's my wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.42,1:22:14.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么呢\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.60,1:22:22.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这他妈是什么情况\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.10,1:22:24.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不需要庭审\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No trial is necessary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.39,1:22:27.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们认为这个陌生人非法入侵\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We find this stranger guilty of trespassing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.40,1:22:30.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,判决是黑暗  黎明执行\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sentence is darkness, to be carried out at dawn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.98,1:22:32.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你什么意思\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.86,1:22:34.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿  啊\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey... ah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.95,1:22:38.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你逃不掉的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't get away with this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.78,1:22:40.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人们会来找我的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People will come for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.70,1:22:42.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们知道我在哪\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They know where I am!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.12,1:22:44.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  没人会来的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No one will ever come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.66,1:22:46.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍妮弗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jennifer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.09,1:22:57.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.47,1:22:59.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.68,1:23:01.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.39,1:23:05.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个人是你父亲\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That man is your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.66,1:23:20.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经做出了选择\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've made my choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.94,1:23:55.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍  嘘\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jen. Shh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.94,1:23:58.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们时间不多了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't have much time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.57,1:24:01.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你找到了上来的路  你知道回去哪条路安全吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You found your way up here. Do you know a safe way back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.62,1:24:04.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.54,1:24:06.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.00,1:24:12.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你用箭射了我\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shot me with an arrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.04,1:24:15.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然他们会把我们俩都杀了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They would've killed us both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.09,1:24:16.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  我们走\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.19,1:24:38.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是干什么\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.99,1:24:40.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该走了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.36,1:24:42.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么是现在\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.20,1:24:44.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为明天早上他们会杀了我爸爸\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because tomorrow morning, they're gonna kill my dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.16,1:24:46.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得走了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.41,1:24:48.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.20,1:24:49.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不去了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.00,1:24:53.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.92,1:24:55.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些人看清我了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These people see me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.88,1:24:57.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我属于他们\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I belong to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.84,1:25:01.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们属于我\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They belong to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.76,1:25:04.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}(50.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.97,1:25:07.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会阻止你的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't stop you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.36,1:25:22.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的觉得你能回到过去的生活吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you really think you can go back to your old life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.50,1:25:40.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟紧我\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.47,1:25:50.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这扇门从没像这样锁过\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This gate's never locked like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.68,1:25:53.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.44,1:26:02.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露丝\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ruthie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.15,1:26:04.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得走了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.82,1:26:06.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你明白吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.87,1:26:11.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你有时候喜欢偷偷下山\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you like to sneak down the mountain sometimes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.37,1:26:13.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道另一条出口吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know another way out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.12,1:26:57.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,穿过那里\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Through there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.08,1:26:59.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说那里有出口\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're saying there's a way out through there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.10,1:27:17.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想跟我一起走吗  露丝\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want to come with me, ruthie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.86,1:27:21.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想的话就可以\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can if you want to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.31,1:27:56.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.29,1:29:48.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aw, geez.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.55,1:29:52.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大白天的我都差点没上来\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I barely made it up here in the daylight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.55,1:29:53.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘘\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.93,1:29:56.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听到了吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you hear that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.87,1:30:21.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.33,1:30:23.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.39,1:30:42.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.36,1:30:51.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.61,1:30:56.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.75,1:31:15.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能闻到你的味道\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can smell your juices.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.72,1:31:30.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等温尼伯夺走你的眼睛  耳朵和舌头\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After venable takes your eyes, your ears, and your tongue,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.31,1:31:31.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要把你据为己有\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to keep you for myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.55,1:31:57.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.06,1:32:10.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.87,1:32:25.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.70,1:32:29.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍妮弗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jennifer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.63,1:32:41.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
