Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.73,1:33:41.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们现在怎么办\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do we do now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.28,1:33:45.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在最重要的是做出下一个选择\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All that matters now is the next choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.37,1:33:48.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是我在这座山上学到的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what I've learned on this mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.62,1:33:52.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是这样活下来的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's how I've survived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.10,1:34:13.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.37,1:34:30.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪条路\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:35.87,1:34:37.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说过会再见到你的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Told you I'd see you again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.50,1:34:41.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我退后\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back the fuck up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.34,1:34:42.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下  我们是来帮忙的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa, wait a minute. We're here to help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.88,1:34:44.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胡扯  操你妈\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bullshit. And fuck you, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.92,1:34:47.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先生  我之前是想救你的命\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, mister, I was trying to save your life back there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.80,1:34:51.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得好好揍你一顿  你就能卷铺盖走人了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I figured a good beat down might send your ass packing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.31,1:34:53.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.14,1:34:56.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我黄色的眼眸\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That yellow in my eyes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.27,1:34:58.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的肝脏在折磨我\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was my liver turning on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.81,1:35:00.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是对的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.57,1:35:04.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有孩子\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I ain't got any kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.28,1:35:09.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我侄子六年前在这片树林里失踪了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But my nephew disappeared in these woods six years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.37,1:35:12.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直没找到他的尸体\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I never found the body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.70,1:35:14.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死的创建会\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fucking foundation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.83,1:35:18.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真想一枪崩了那些混蛋\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like to shoot every one of those sons of bitches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.96,1:35:21.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的朋友们呢\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's your friends?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.59,1:35:24.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有我们了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.46,1:35:27.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们带你们下山吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then, let's get you the hell off this mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.97,1:35:31.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.02,1:35:40.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.44,1:35:47.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈的  不  不  不\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck! No, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.40,1:35:50.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会打死你的  他在哪\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get you. Where the fuck is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.92,1:36:03.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想我们干掉他们了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we got 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.15,1:36:26.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快快快快\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go, go, go, go, go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.49,1:36:32.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍妮弗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jennifer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.83,1:36:35.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上车\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in the truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.24,1:36:36.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上车\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.18,1:37:44.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我叔公威利的特殊配方\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my great-uncle Willie's special recipe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.02,1:37:48.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  随你便\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, suit yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.31,1:38:28.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想在明晚之前做好准备\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to set that footing by tomorrow evening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.27,1:38:30.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  亲爱的  嘿  老爸\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Hi, sweetie. Hey, dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.27,1:38:31.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给你带来了修改后的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I brought you the revised blueprints{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.98,1:38:33.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,北考德威尔住宅蓝图  你开玩笑吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the north Caldwell house. Oh, you're kidding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.82,1:38:35.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没必要带到这里来\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't need to bring them all the way down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.78,1:38:37.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你想马上看\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you wanted to see them right away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.49,1:38:40.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还知道你会讨厌新的主浴室\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I also know you're gonna hate the new master bath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.45,1:38:42.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是有警告过我\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you did warn me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.20,1:38:43.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯哼\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mm-hm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.62,1:38:46.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.92,1:38:49.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么我真为你骄傲\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing. I'm just proud of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.67,1:38:51.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢了  老爸\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.97,1:38:55.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱一下\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.80,1:39:00.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.51,1:39:02.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也爱你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.85,1:39:09.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, good night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.65,1:39:10.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回家见\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll see you at home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.48,1:39:14.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记住  今晚是披萨和电影之夜\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, and remember, it's pizza and movie night,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.36,1:39:15.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以别迟到了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so don't be late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.95,1:39:19.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,男孩们选了《食人族家族》\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The boys picked something with inbred cannibals?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.49,1:39:20.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又一次\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.95,1:39:24.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Geez.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.02,1:39:49.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是隐藏荧幕\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a privacy screen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.73,1:39:51.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦  是啊\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.15,1:39:52.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从侧面看不到\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't see it from the side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.44,1:39:54.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了开始吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.11,1:39:55.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, hi, hon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.57,1:39:59.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来见见我们的新邻居  约翰和露丝\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, meet our new neighbors, John and ruthie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.45,1:40:02.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们在看街尾的卡普兰房子\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're looking at the kaplan house down the street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.33,1:40:03.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都还没定下来\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing is set in stone yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.91,1:40:06.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来约翰认识史考特\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it turns out John knows Scott.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.37,1:40:08.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有过交集\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our paths crossed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.92,1:40:13.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说如果我来附近的话  可以来见见他的家人\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Said if I was ever in the neighborhood to stop by and meet the family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.63,1:40:16.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,世界真小  对吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Small world, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.34,1:40:19.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  非常小\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Very.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.76,1:40:24.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要把东西放下吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you going to put those groceries down?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.06,1:40:27.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,科琳\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Corinne...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.39,1:40:29.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这咖啡太好喝了  谢谢\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This coffee is wonderful, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.90,1:40:33.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们能留下来吃晚餐吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, can you stay for dinner?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.15,1:40:35.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史考特肯定很想见你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure Scott would love to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.86,1:40:38.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要吃披萨\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're having pizza.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.19,1:40:40.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.53,1:40:43.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们很乐意留下\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We would love to stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.16,1:40:45.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们开了很久的车\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been a long drive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.62,1:40:49.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你  我马上回来\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. Oh, be right back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.00,1:40:54.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看出来你怀了双胞胎\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I see you're eating for two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.84,1:40:58.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝贺你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congratulations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.38,1:41:00.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要上厕所\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to use the bathroom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.99,1:41:28.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滚出我家  珍\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the fuck out of my house. Jen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.12,1:41:31.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放下武器  不然我就杀了你全家\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put your weapon down, or I kill your family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.75,1:41:36.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看错你了  珍\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was wrong about you, Jen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.05,1:41:39.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很强悍\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.42,1:41:42.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我想离开你  我就必须强悍\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had to be if I was ever gonna get away from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.34,1:41:44.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在该回家了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now it's time to come home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.22,1:41:46.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么意义呢  你会杀了我\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the point? You have to kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:46.47,1:41:47.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.47,1:41:51.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但要等到我们的孩子出生\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But not until our child is born.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.69,1:41:56.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭喜你  奶奶\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congratulations, grandma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.55,1:42:24.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jen...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.43,1:42:29.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在做什么\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.51,1:42:32.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.44,1:42:38.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.48,1:42:41.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和男孩们能回避一下吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you and the boys excuse us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.32,1:42:43.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰是来谈生意的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John's here to talk business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.07,1:42:46.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然可以  来吧  小蓝\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course. Come on. Laundry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.66,1:42:50.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  你想吃披萨吗  小迷糊\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. You want pizza? Mush.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.47,1:43:06.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看错你了珍\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was wrong about you, Jen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.72,1:43:09.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很强悍\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.22,1:43:12.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我想离开你  我必须强悍\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had to be if I was ever gonna get away from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.77,1:43:15.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你使我们让你变得很强悍\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You let us make you strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.35,1:43:17.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.77,1:43:20.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怀了我的孩子所以\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're carrying my child, so...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.53,1:43:25.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该回家了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to come home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.45,1:43:31.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向我保证你不会伤害他们\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Promise me you won't hurt them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.08,1:43:35.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永远不会\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.87,1:43:39.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你再也不会回来了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll never come back here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:41.25,1:43:42.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向我保证  我就跟你一起去\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Promise, and I'll go with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:44.13,1:43:45.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我向你保证\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have my word.{\r}